.git
.gitignore
.next
.DS_Store
# T23 (F-102): Docker matches a bare name at the context root only; nested
# Finder files shipped in every image and moved the tree hash.
**/.DS_Store
**/._*
.tiltignore
nexcode-data/
node_modules/
helm/
scratch/
*.session.json
*.local
*.md
# T22 (design D4): the developer's macOS virtualenv was copied into every Linux
# image as a 1.4 GB tree of dangling symlinks (F-6); the agent configuration and
# the audit documents have no runtime role. tests/ deliberately stays IN the
# image — the seven in-pod gates run from it (the session-21 correction to F-7).
.venv/
.claude/
inputs/
*.log
